{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"877b99c0f256f0098ef59f4ff0092803b90771be7b60e636b6a6c218214f428b","ja":"記憶をたどってみよう！","zh":"试着追寻记忆吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"11eff0b1fde6e11ad56980691aec53a53ae09506735ecbde065ccbd273522d41","ja":"学校と家とお仕事と……それ以外だと……\n確か一昨日は、ここでみんなの写真を眺めてました。","zh":"学校、家里、工作……除此之外的话……\n我记得前天还在这里看大家拍的照片来着。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"117e0c2368549a8a5c171e49d4b5076e41c00d87bfee0f0cbe74b38ba797a37d","ja":"ああ、学園バトルの撮影のときの？\n合間にちょくちょく撮ってたものね。","zh":"啊，是拍校园战斗戏那时候的？\n休息间隙确实经常拍呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"03dfd0b4058cd795c2b0d024ebc4028ea2d788ce0206303e9e06c7355e5c269d","ja":"はい♪　アルバムにまとめてもらってたので、\nけっこう、長い時間見入っちゃってて。","zh":"是的♪　因为都帮我整理进相册里了，\n所以不知不觉就看了好久。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b1eb02637790f641327b326a96a50b7cea99ada3c7ad990db12ab34fde3ffb7f","ja":"なるほど……これにヒントはないかしら？\n誰かから預かってる、大切な写真があるとか……？","zh":"原来如此……这里面会不会有什么提示呢？\n比如替谁保管的重要照片之类的……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a71e0946155dbb1246b164b4f649eeec2e68b7354c84252c5f08ed2bf36459fe","ja":"写真、写真……\nうーん、ちょっと思い浮かばないですね～……。","zh":"照片，照片……\n唔——有点想不出来呢～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7ace32b8f281c6287b277c2a02a3eb52cc3dc89710a524b1c8c02b33cf2e6b24","ja":"写真は関係ないのかしら……？\nそれじゃあ、場所を移動してみましょ！","zh":"和照片没关系吗……？\n既然这样，就换个地方看看吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4ad7884097c731b2167f3a0b2fd281658a13939417d357b3c8f4b1c9f215c8dd","ja":"昨日は、お仕事が終わってから、\nここでお散歩してました。","zh":"昨天工作结束后，\n我在这里散了步。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"dd7e88c8829f3f8a7787ef0fb305f2b0e75e3054a05206b509721fa049e2ac6a","ja":"ここ、チューリップがすごく綺麗なんですよ♪\nお手入れされている方が、いるみたいで。","zh":"这里的郁金香开得特别漂亮哦♪\n好像是有人一直在悉心打理呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"68f7cab75f0a08910c2df4ed983249e25496e08cbf34f56a6abc4fc736712fbe","ja":"あら、本当！\nとってもかわいいわね♪","zh":"哎呀，真的呢！\n非常可爱呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a4631eed4872d82a5790b145df49bab56d64b557ae173a7ceb4700c64c1249c4","ja":"公園、お花……ガーデニング？\nお花に、お水をあげるのを忘れてた……とか？","zh":"公园、花……园艺？\n难道是……忘了给花浇水？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"d1f7ccd6a6e6df190b6ff8fafbc2f143346d172727a8af1c6c0b749d5d5d68b9","ja":"うーん……それも違うと思います。\nごめんなさい。せっかく付き合ってもらってるのに。","zh":"唔……我觉得那个也不太对。\n对不起，明明难得让你陪我一起。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8c209e086285bd9fc0b067a5a6ae01ff955f7ce603e5c31fa07f7594586c692d","ja":"ううん。一緒に、アルバムやお花も見れたんだもの。\nむしろ嬉しいくらいよ♪","zh":"不会呀。毕竟还能一起看相册和花呢。\n我反而觉得很开心哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"07b212a2df95fb3e9f7ad4f0cc562e5965e913e45612639a6bcbcc519ceadde0","ja":"ありがとうございます！　このみさんってすっごく\n大人ですよね。うっかり忘れることなんてなさそう。","zh":"谢谢！木实小姐真的非常\n成熟呢。感觉完全不会迷迷糊糊地忘东忘西。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"083904742134010dbd08a4603fc145f4658c531b3c96fd9cd5ebb5183fac5c81","ja":"あら、そんなことないわよ？　この間だって、\n3カ月前からエステサロンを予約してたのに……。","zh":"哎呀，没有这回事哦？前阵子也是，\n明明提早3个月就预约好了美容沙龙……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"c1cc70f6847315d76871a330bc845829071e13955a6cb968feca9e67dc6904a0","ja":"うっかり忘れてたの。連絡がきてから\n大慌てでお店に行って、謝ってきたわ。","zh":"我不小心给忘了。接到联络后\n我急急忙忙赶去店里道了歉。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"c8fd79db955ee1822ef2fb70e7229f14b5cb75693f2ab7e35150362dccdb8ebb","ja":"でも、なんとかギリギリ施術は受けられたの。\nだから春香ちゃんも、まだ間に合うかもしれないわよ！","zh":"不过，好歹千钧一发之际还是赶上了做护理。\n所以春香，你也可能还来得及哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1742.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"8dd036f2fb35863d92f5ecabd0948cd7bab4bfc63792ac9af0a2eda5105c7904","ja":"あっ……ふふっ、はい！\nじゃあもう少しだけ、よろしくお願いします♪","zh":"啊……呵呵，好的！\n那就再麻烦您稍微陪我一会儿啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
